# The Dockerfiles clone llama.cpp themselves and COPY nothing from the build
# context, so BuildKit skips the context transfer entirely today. This file is
# the guard for the day someone adds a COPY: models/ holds multi-GB GGUFs and
# llama.cpp/ a full source tree, and neither belongs in a build context.
models/
llama.cpp/
*.gguf
.git/
.github/
.pi-subagents/
